#
# Verible lint rules for make lint (5.sim-regression), --rules_config:
# Verible's defaults, but
# - parameters: CamelCase as pcieVHost names them (NodeNum, DataWidth), or
#   our ALL_CAPS; localparams: ALL_CAPS or CamelCase
# - no line limit: port lists and comment tables run past 100 columns, and
#   the files are not run through verible-verilog-format
# - tasks and functions in a module are static by default (IEEE 1800-2023
#   13.3.1); writing "static" adds nothing
parameter-name-style=parameter_style:CamelCase|ALL_CAPS;localparam_style:ALL_CAPS|CamelCase
-line-length
-explicit-task-lifetime
-explicit-function-lifetime
